      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the interface util on core-rt-lyon-01 and it's actually well below 40%. nothing obvious there. the spikes seem totally random though, not like a predictable congestion pattern. could it be a physical layer issue or maybe something intermittent with the hardware itself?",
